== Description ==

'''Cement''' is a building material in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Concrete Mixer]] and the [[Cutting Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 37 downstream recipes at the [[Concrete Mixer]] and the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Concrete]], [[Cement]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

